            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Why doesn't the power tool take-off socket work?",
            "text": "<p>This can be caused by:<br/><br/>1) Power tool wattage is not compatible with the power tool take-off socket. Check the wattage is compatible with the power tool take-off socket.<br/>2) Incorrect operating mode selected. Ensure the switch is moved into position II. </p>",
